span class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa nav-indicator\"></span></a><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--primary-navy);font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;transition:all 0.4s ease;opacity:0.85;position:relative;padding:0.5rem 0\" class=\"nav-link-premium\" href=\"/#team\">Our Team<span class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa nav-indicator\"></span></a><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--primary-navy);font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;transition:all 0.4s ease;opacity:0.85;position:relative;padding:0.5rem 0\" class=\"nav-link-premium\" href=\"/placement-test\">Placement Test<span class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa nav-indicator\"></span></a><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;margin-left:auto\" class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa\"><button style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);color:var(--primary-navy);padding:0.5rem 0.8rem;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.7rem;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s ease\" class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa\">EN</button><button style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);color:var(--primary-navy);width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s ease\" class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa\"><i style=\"font-size:1rem\" class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa fa-solid fa-moon\"></i></button></div></div><button style=\"background:none;border:none;color:var(--primary-navy);font-size:1.8rem;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem\" class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa mobile-only\"><i class=\"jsx-abc7212591fceafa fa-solid fa-bars\"></i></button></div></nav><div style=\"position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:0%;height:4px;background:var(--accent-gold);z-index:2000;transition:width 0.2s ease-out\"></div><section style=\"min-height:100vh;background-color:var(--primary-navy)\"></section><section id=\"clients\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-color-alt);padding:5rem 0;overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"container